                "sourceRegion": "Teacher answer 23(b), upper right column",
                "description": "A seven-by-seven dot square partitioned into eight triangular groups of six dots and one central dot. Source pink, blue and yellow distinctions use house red, blue and orange.",
                "mathematics": "8T_3+1=8(6)+1=49=(2(3)+1)^2; the arrangement generalises to eight T_n groups and one central dot.",
                "answerVisibility": "Solution only; the student question contains no supplied picture."
